{"id":"blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot","lines":[{"t":1.045,"end":4.789,"chars":[0],"who":"Niko","text":"Time for Okawa to take the lead and pick up the ball in his own half!","de":"Jetzt übernimmt Okawa und holt sich den Ball in der eigenen Hälfte!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":4.288,"end":5.512,"chars":[1],"who":"Okawa","text":"(hngh)","de":"(hngh)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":4.955,"end":9.155,"chars":[0],"who":"Niko","text":"And unlike the previous 89 minutes, it won't be Okawa going on a solo run!","de":"Und anders als in den 89 Minuten davor geht Okawa diesmal nicht allein los!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":9.379,"end":11.443,"chars":[0],"who":"Niko","text":"In the last 60 seconds","de":"In den letzten 60 Sekunden","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":9.963,"end":10.923,"chars":[2],"who":"Team Y Player","text":"Huh?","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":10.626,"end":11.274,"chars":[3],"who":"Gagamaru","text":"(little \"huh\" in the background)","de":"(leises „Hä?“ im Hintergrund)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":11.642,"end":14.522,"chars":[0],"who":"Niko","text":"Everyone on Team Y joins in on the attack!","de":"Das ganze Team Y stürmt mit nach vorne!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":14.82,"end":17.484,"chars":[0],"who":"Niko","text":"We call it the one-time kill counter","de":"Wir nennen das den One-Time-Kill-Konter","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":17.376,"end":18.768,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"(gasp)","de":"(keucht)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":21.491,"end":23.699,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"This is bad, he tricked us","de":"Mist, er hat uns reingelegt","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":24.364,"end":28.684,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"We committed too many players to the attack, creating a weakness in our defense!","de":"Wir haben zu viele Spieler nach vorne geschickt — jetzt hat unsere Abwehr ein Loch!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":29.433,"end":31.617,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"If they score, it's over!","de":"Wenn die ein Tor machen, ist es aus!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":32.117,"end":33.341,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"No way...","de":"Das darf nicht wahr sein …","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":34.237,"end":38.197,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"I won't let this happen!","de":"Das lasse ich nicht zu!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":40.436,"end":42.596,"chars":[5],"who":"Raichi","text":"You serious? We're so dead","de":"Ist das dein Ernst? Wir sind sowas von erledigt","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":41.888,"end":44.048,"chars":[6],"who":"Igaguri","text":"Everyone! Get back!","de":"Alle! Zurück!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":43.831,"end":46.159,"chars":[7],"who":"Team Z Player","text":"Not good, someone stop him!","de":"Nicht gut, haltet ihn auf!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":46.171,"end":48.139,"chars":[7],"who":"Team Z Player","text":"It's up to you, block him!","de":"Jetzt liegt's an dir, block ihn!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":46.722,"end":47.874,"chars":[8],"who":"Chigiri","text":"(hmph)","de":"(hmph)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":52.692,"end":56.196,"chars":[9],"who":"Lemon","text":"It's one on one, if I don't save this, it's over","de":"Eins gegen eins — wenn ich den nicht halte, ist es vorbei","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":56.252,"end":58.58,"chars":[9],"who":"Lemon","text":"All our soccer careers end here","de":"Unsere ganzen Fußballkarrieren enden hier","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":58.699,"end":59.995,"chars":[9],"who":"Lemon","text":"Forever!","de":"Für immer!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":60.613,"end":63.637,"chars":[9],"who":"Lemon","text":"I have to block his shot no matter what!","de":"Ich muss seinen Schuss abwehren, koste es, was es wolle!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":64.221,"end":66.213,"chars":[9],"who":"Lemon","text":"(shocked)","de":"(geschockt)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":68.782,"end":70.294,"chars":[9],"who":"Lemon","text":"Where'd he come from?","de":"Wo kommt der denn her?","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":70.595,"end":71.891,"chars":[9],"who":"Lemon","text":"(ugh)","de":"(ugh)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":73.142,"end":77.27,"chars":[10],"who":"Naruhaya","text":"It's all over… we're screwed","de":"Es ist alles vorbei … wir sind geliefert","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":82.206,"end":83.502,"chars":[1],"who":"Okawa","text":"Huh?","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":82.223,"end":83.447,"chars":[9],"who":"Lemon","text":"Huh?","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":86.489,"end":89.609,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"Here, you and I know this spot, right?","de":"Hier — du und ich kennen diesen Ort, oder?","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":89.849,"end":93.785,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"'Cause it's where we belong, the place where you can smell a goal!","de":"Denn hier gehören wir hin. Der Ort, an dem man ein Tor riechen kann!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":93.507,"end":94.491,"chars":[0],"who":"Niko","text":"Huh?","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":96.291,"end":100.803,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"You and I are alike, the way we think and how we read the field","de":"Du und ich sind uns ähnlich — wie wir denken und wie wir das Spiel lesen","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":101.122,"end":106.066,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"Instead of taking the shot yourself, you pass to Okawa to finish us off","de":"Statt selbst zu schießen, passt du zu Okawa, damit er uns erledigt","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":106.118,"end":111.11,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"That's why you lost, Niko. At the last moment you chose to give up the ball","de":"Deshalb hast du verloren, Niko. Im letzten Moment hast du den Ball abgegeben","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":111.769,"end":113.761,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"Which means you're no striker at all!","de":"Das heißt, du bist überhaupt kein Stürmer!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":116.316,"end":121.188,"chars":[1],"who":"Okawa","text":"Oh shit! Stupid punks are countering! Get back! Steal the ball!","de":"Oh Scheiße! Die Penner kontern! Zurück! Holt euch den Ball!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":121.296,"end":125.904,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"I chose… rather than taking the shot. I cried when I lost","de":"Ich hab mich damals gegen den Schuss entschieden. Ich hab geweint, als ich verloren hab","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":126.199,"end":131.383,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"But that version of myself is a memory, I don't need it anymore. I WANT TO WIN!","de":"Aber dieses alte Ich ist nur noch eine Erinnerung, ich brauche es nicht mehr. ICH WILL GEWINNEN!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/39.mp3"},{"t":133.444,"end":136.084,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"Now is the time TO BE REBORN!","de":"Jetzt ist es Zeit, NEU GEBOREN ZU WERDEN!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/40.mp3"},{"t":136.278,"end":137.574,"chars":[11],"who":"Kunigami","text":"Ugh","de":"Ugh","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/41.mp3"},{"t":138.594,"end":140.346,"chars":[11],"who":"Kunigami","text":"Nice pass, Isagi","de":"Guter Pass, Isagi","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/42.mp3"},{"t":140.579,"end":144.347,"chars":[12],"who":"Team Y Player 2","text":"(grunts)","de":"(grunzt)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/43.mp3"},{"t":140.6,"end":143.864,"chars":[2],"who":"Team Y Player","text":"Foul him if you have to, just stop him!","de":"Foul ihn, wenn's sein muss, halt ihn einfach auf!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/44.mp3"},{"t":141.056,"end":146.144,"chars":[11],"who":"Kunigami","text":"(grunting) Damn it! It's up to you!","de":"(ächzt) Verdammt! Jetzt liegt's an dir!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/45.mp3"},{"t":145.643,"end":147.251,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"Ou!","de":"Ou!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/46.mp3"},{"t":147.449,"end":149.201,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"I read you loud and clear!","de":"Hab dich genau verstanden!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/47.mp3"},{"t":148.971,"end":150.291,"chars":[2],"who":"Team Y Player","text":"Take him out!","de":"Schaltet ihn aus!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/48.mp3"},{"t":150.794,"end":151.97,"chars":[12],"who":"Team Y Player 2","text":"(falling noise)","de":"(fällt hin)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/49.mp3"},{"t":152.598,"end":155.91,"chars":[2],"who":"Team Y Player","text":"(grunts, then falls)","de":"(grunzt und fällt)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/50.mp3"},{"t":154.749,"end":155.445,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"(little grunt)","de":"(kleines Grunzen)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/51.mp3"},{"t":157.73,"end":159.722,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"I'll leave the rest to you!","de":"Den Rest überlasse ich dir!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/52.mp3"},{"t":160.004,"end":160.604,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"(kicks the ball)","de":"(schießt den Ball)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/53.mp3"},{"t":161.76,"end":164.352,"chars":[3],"who":"Gagamaru","text":"That's low, but okay, I'll take it!","de":"Ganz schön flach, aber okay, den nehm ich!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/54.mp3"},{"t":164.427,"end":165.963,"chars":[3],"who":"Gagamaru","text":"Huh? (falls)","de":"Huh? (fällt)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/55.mp3"},{"t":165.913,"end":167.809,"chars":[6],"who":"Igaguri","text":"HE MISSED, WE'RE DEAD!","de":"ER HAT DANEBEN GESCHOSSEN, WIR SIND ERLEDIGT!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/56.mp3"},{"t":167.604,"end":170.868,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"No. You didn't notice I was aiming beyond him","de":"Nein. Du hast nicht gemerkt, dass ich an ihm vorbei gezielt habe","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/57.mp3"},{"t":172.815,"end":174.375,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"At number eleven!","de":"Auf Nummer elf!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/58.mp3"},{"t":174.881,"end":175.841,"chars":[0],"who":"Niko","text":"(huh)","de":"(huh)","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/59.mp3"},{"t":175.824,"end":177.384,"chars":[1],"who":"Okawa","text":"He's there? But how?","de":"Er ist da? Aber wie?","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/60.mp3"},{"t":177.397,"end":178.621,"chars":[11],"who":"Kunigami","text":"Go!","de":"Los!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/61.mp3"},{"t":178.718,"end":181.55,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"Score it, you egoist!","de":"Hau ihn rein, du Egoist!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/62.mp3"},{"t":182,"end":184.184,"chars":[13],"who":"Bachira","text":"Yoichi Isagi!","de":"Yoichi Isagi!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/63.mp3"},{"t":184.473,"end":187.569,"chars":[4],"who":"Isagi","text":"I am… A STRIKER!","de":"Ich bin … ein STÜRMER!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/64.mp3"},{"t":198.134,"end":200.6,"chars":[10],"who":"Naruhaya","text":"YEAH!!!!!!!!","de":"JAAA!!!!!!!!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/65.mp3"},{"t":198.176,"end":200.6,"chars":[14],"who":"Kuon","text":"YEAH!!!","de":"JAAA!!!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/66.mp3"},{"t":198.176,"end":200.6,"chars":[6],"who":"Igaguri","text":"YEAH!!!","de":"JAAA!!!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/67.mp3"},{"t":198.176,"end":200.6,"chars":[7],"who":"Team Z Player","text":"YEAH!!!","de":"JAAA!!!","orig":"scenes/blue_lock_isagis_direct_shot/lines/68.mp3"}]}